                  kidney function decline, reduced albuminuria, and lowered the risk of kidney failure or                   article.

                  substantial loss of kidney function in patients with glomerular diseases. These findings                  Group Information: The FIND-CKD
                                                                                                                            Investigators are listed in
                  suggest an important role for finerenone in preserving kidney function in this population.                Supplement 3.
